  <item>
    <title>Vol 06.停止恐惧与亏欠，塑造自洽的精彩人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668b967d9d1baa362143c565</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668b967d9d1baa362143c565</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jul 2024 07:34:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：瑞秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：瑞秋是一个充满活力的白羊座和INFJ的自由职业者。在今天的播客里，她分享了自己对于恐惧、亏欠和停止这三个深刻的话题的思考。通过OH卡探索，瑞秋不仅揭开了心中的不安与期待，还发现了纠结与释然之间的平衡。欢迎听众加入这场内心探索之旅，让我们共同寻找生活中的阳光和力量。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">00:01:00</a>:探索内心的情绪世界：OH卡探索和解读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">00:05:55</a>:选择讨论恐惧、停止、亏欠三个主题的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">00:06:46</a> :积极的悲伤主义者：追寻自由的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">00:08:17</a>:起起伏伏的人生之旅探索信念系统和情绪起伏的拉扯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">00:10:10</a>:慢下来，再试一次，可以收获多一次的机会与成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">00:11:54</a>:面对他人否定，从恐惧到寻找契合点，展现不同的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">00:17:40</a>:思考成长中的恐惧与亏欠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">00:20:14</a>:爱与金钱：父母的爱是祝福也是压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">00:24:27</a>:与父母建立更加和谐良好的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">00:29:04</a>:在瑜伽中找到自我：拥抱坦淡与真实的能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1869">00:31:09</a>:允许自己做自己，重新建立自己的边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">00:36:15</a>:建立自我评价体系，拥抱内在的平和与喜悦</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrGf4gWTy5CXFQTl6OADWxLIz8n_.m4a" length="40173469" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:23</itunes:duration>
